      "writtenOn": "2025-06-09T17:55:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe so, yes. I think this extends to `max_current_claimed_bitmask` and its accessors. In patchset 3, this variable is only written to, never read. I think it can be deleted.",
      "parentUuid": "5d6116d3_dbdf1ad3",
