        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-02T20:45:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The generic version of this function compares to `CONFIG_USB_PD_3A_PORTS`, because that value is coherent with the generic implementation. The reason we\u0027re making this change is that `CONFIG_USB_PD_3A_PORTS` is 0 for ciri, even though that doesn\u0027t make sense. Consequently, this condition will always be false, and that\u0027s not obvious from looking at it.\n\nSince this is specific to ciri, I\u0027d suggest just removing the checking against `CONFIG_USB_PD_3A_PORTS` and maybe leaving a comment that ciri can only source 3A out of one port. We should probably open a bug to track the weird ciri sourcing behavior itself, and we could link to that bug in the comment.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 122,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 124,
        "endChar": 28
      },
